{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409430/extras/2-EN.png?t=1745311600\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The basic gameplay of Shrink Rooms is to solve puzzles by <strong>pushing boxes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different from other puzzle games, the walls of the level's room will <strong>contract inward at the end of each round</strong>. You must accurately plan the number of steps for pushing boxes to escape from the secret room, so as to avoid being crushed into a puddle of flesh by the walls.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409430/extras/gif1.gif?t=1745311600\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409430/extras/3-EN.png?t=1745311600\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are various interesting mechanisms in the shrink rooms. The characteristics of different mechanisms are combined to generate many puzzles with rich variations and high difficulty. Welcome to challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409430/extras/gif2.gif?t=1745311600\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409430/extras/4-EN.png?t=1745311600\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can move freely in the selection scene. You can choose easier puzzles to continue the game, or try to solve all difficult puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the same time, in addition to solving puzzles, you can also explore and collect virtual exhibits and find hidden levels in the scene to explore different fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409430/extras/gif3.gif?t=1745311600\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409430/extras/5-EN.png?t=1745311600\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200+ levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 themed chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">X+ exhibits with unique drawings and descriptions.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3409430?t=1745311600","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745311600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409430/08b17650aa9b3d1433c512cc773224c98bb0a977/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745311600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409430/08b17650aa9b3d1433c512cc773224c98bb0a977/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745311600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3454020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Add To Wishlist!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are interested in Shrink Rooms, please <strong>Add To your wishlist now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is very important for our game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to communicate or know more about this game,please join our Dicord channel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409430/extras/2-EN.png?t=1745311600\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The basic gameplay of Shrink Rooms is to solve puzzles by <strong>pushing boxes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different from other puzzle games, the walls of the leve